Feature: Mark all as completed

  Background:
    Given I Visit "/"
    And I Add "buy some cheese"
    And I Add "feed the cat"
    And I Add "book a doctors appointment"

  Scenario: Marking all as completed
    When I Check the Toggle-all
    Then I should See "0 items left"

  Scenario: Clearing the complete state of all
    When I Check the Toggle-all
    And I Uncheck the Toggle-all
    Then I should See "3 items left"

  @fixme
  Scenario: Toggle-all follows the todos
    When I Check the Toggle-all
    Then the Toggle-all should be Checked
    When I Untick the Todo "buy some cheese"
    Then the Toggle-all should Not be Checked
    When I Tick the Todo "buy some cheese"
    Then the Toggle-all should be Checked
